message: "If you use this work or its derived data, please cite it as below."
title: "US Care Safety Signals"
abstract: >-
  Analyses of publicly available US federal data on patient and caregiver
  safety in healthcare facilities. The first analysis covers CMS-published
  hospital-acquired pressure injury rates (PSI-03) across 3,056 US acute
  care hospitals, combined with Hospital-Acquired Condition Reduction
  Program penalty data for FY2026. The second analysis covers
  resident-handling injuries among 24,292 nursing-facility cases reported
  to OSHA's Injury Tracking Application for 2025, with a hand-labeled
  validation sample.
type: dataset
